Third-party reference databases used by this pipeline are subject to their
own licenses. Please review the following before redistribution:

  SILVA rRNA database     https://www.arb-silva.de/silva-license-information/
  UNITE fungal ITS        https://unite.ut.ee/cite.php
  MitoFish 12S            https://mitofish.aori.u-tokyo.ac.jp/
  PR2 protist database    https://github.com/pr2database/pr2database (GPL-2)
  MIDORI2 COI             https://www.reference-midori.info/
  NCBI sequences          https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/

Classifier QZA files trained from these databases inherit the database license
and should not be redistributed without complying with those terms.
